              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhi ikiaro ya Ebhuraimu tëbhaarugiri Abhakanaani bhano bhaamenyërë Geseri haara, nabho mbaamenyërë hamui na abhantö bha Ebhuraimu.",
          "type": "text",
